"workflow/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been "
"reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and "
"welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/stock-logistics-workflow/issues/new?"
"body=module:%20stock_picking_batch_extended%0Aversion:"
